title The product read from both ends, and a note whose spelling came home
prompt Autonomous loop -- Standfast on reds, then the next agent-doable lap Lindy-first crux-first on the Caravan lift arc
think Read KYRI.md and RADIANT_STYLE.md first, then crux/REMEMBER.md and the top three rows of session-logs/README.md. The newest recommend named bearing_note as the fall head at 342 over thirty-nine rungs, widening nothing.
think Standfast before new work. crux/REDS.md reads every row through %144 CLOSED -- %142, %143, and %144 each carry a CLOSED headline with a witness on metal behind it. Nothing open and agent-closable, so the line is clear and constructive work may begin.
think Priced the family before touching it. tools/fixtures/ladder_reach_visibility_scan.sh bearing_note read declared=39 identical=39 lines=12, widens=0 across every kind, stub=3, fall=342. Hashed the body in all thirty-nine rungs by hand as a second reading: one hash, thirty-nine files.
think Wrote the lifted body into caravan/ladder_checks.rye directly above bearing_published, which was already lifted. The signature takes the rung as a comptime type parameter and reaches rung.max_queue_len, rung.phase_bit, rung.plan_name, rung.seat_note, and rung.NoteError through it. Both invariant asserts travelled with the body unchanged.
think Replaced the twelve-line body in all thirty-nine rungs with a three-line stub returning ladder_checks.bearing_note(@This(), io, held, borne_mask). A python pass over caravan/*.rye matched the exact elder text so a rung whose body had drifted would have been left alone; thirty-nine matched, which is the count the scan predicted.
think Rotated the reach-visibility witness pins one family forward. The folded-this-lap block moved from found_path to bearing_note, the head moved to appraisal_note at 333, answered_by took second at 330, recant_note third at 324, and reclaim_notes was added fourth at 294 -- the first row below the plateau, asserted so the GREEN line's claim about where the plateau ends is a measurement.
think Lowered the carry ceiling in both the witness and the scan default, 61,185 -> 60,843.
obs Carry measured 61,185 -> 60,843 after the lift -- exactly 342, the number the scan formula returned before the lap began. Six laps running the arithmetic has named the fall before the meter read it.
obs The finding worth carrying is that the product rule now holds from both ends. found_path tested it from depth -- sixteen rungs shedding a long body. This row tested it from breadth -- thirty-nine rungs shedding a short one -- and the two returns landed within a rounding of each other. Neither factor is privileged, which is what a product means and what two laps from opposite directions have now shown rather than argued.
obs The second finding is about pairing rather than counting. bearing_note writes a note's glyphs and bearing_published reads them back, and the reading half already stood lifted in this same harness. A pair that must agree on how a note is spelled now agrees in one file. The lift-underneath habit reached a body whose only audience was another lifted body, which is the tightest case for one place this arc has met.
obs The copy guard caught two of my own new GREEN lines on the lap they were written. The reach witness recited sixteen, twenty-five, thirty, and thirty-three in words with no assert holding them, and the carry witness recited thirty-three and thirty-nine the same way -- exactly REDS %110 with REDS %143's spelled-number reader doing the catching. Both lines were rewritten to numbers their own file asserts, which is the honest repair rather than adding asserts to justify prose.
obs The queue this leaves is a plateau with its first measured edge. appraisal_note at 333, answered_by at 330, and recant_note at 324 stand within nine lines of one another, three near-identical twelve-line notes; reclaim_notes sits at 294 below them. The next several laps choose among near-identical products, and the drop after them is now pinned rather than guessed.
obs The council rota row read this lap was Earth and Mercury -- the concrete. The marked value landed on the work directly: every value crossing a seam wears a mark naming its type, and the comptime rung parameter is exactly that mark -- one body serving thirty-nine rungs, each reaching its own ceiling, name, and error set through the type it hands in. Two Rooms read on it too: the queue's four falls are checkable-room facts because they stand asserted in a witness, and the moment one is recited in prose instead, the guard puts it back in the room it belongs to.
